        <section id="how-does-mounjaro-work">
          <h2>How does Mounjaro work in the body?</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>Tirzepatide, the active ingredient in Mounjaro, belongs to a class of drugs called GLP-1 and GIP receptor agonists. These drugs mimic the naturally occurring hormone GLP-1 which is released in the gut after a meal to suppress hunger. It also slows down gastric emptying to make you feel fuller for longer. This results in reduced intake of food which can lead to weight loss.</p>
            <p>Mounjaro prevents the conversion of excess sugar into fat by regulating blood sugar levels in our body. It is usually prescribed when lifestyle modifications have not been effective in weight loss.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="mounjaro-dosage-guide">
          <h2>Mounjaro dosage guide for weight loss</h2>
          <div class="tab-content-sec">
            <p>It is important to follow a Mounjaro dosage plan to make sure that the medication is taken regularly to achieve the maximum weight loss and lessen the chances of side effects</p>
            <p><strong>Mounjaro dosing schedule</strong></p>
            <p><strong><img src="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/media/wysiwyg/WLImage/Mounjaro_Dosage_Schedule.png" data-original="https://www.pharmacyplanet.com/media/wysiwyg/WLImage/Mounjaro_Dosage_Schedule.png" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 814px; height: 682px;" alt="Mounjaro_Dosage_Schedule" width="814" height="682" class="mf-loaded" data-was-processed="true"></strong></p>
            <p>If you are a first-time user, start at the lowest dose of 2.5mg per week for 4 weeks. As long as you are tolerating the medicine, your dose will increase to 5mg per week for the next 4 weeks and then to 7.5mg per week for 4 weeks. The dose can increase again to 10mg per week for 4 weeks, then 12.5mg for 4 weeks, and finally to 15mg per week. You can remain on this dose until your target weight is reached. This is known as the maintenance dose.</p>
            <p>Sticking to the dosing regimen of once weekly until reaching your goal weight is imperative.</p>
            <p>The potential for serious side effects is heightened when Mounjaro is misused. It is important to consult your healthcare provider before adjusting your dosage outside the established dosing schedule and to discuss side effects that might be affecting you.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
